#. type: Plain text
#: pages/index.adoc:8
msgid "{team_summary}"
msgstr "{team_summary}"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/index.adoc:11
#| msgid ""
#| "The Council is composed of a mix of representatives from different areas of "
#| "the project, named roles appointed by Red Hat, and a variable number of "
#| "seats connected to medium-term project goals. Decisions are made by a "
#| "*consensus process*, in which we work together as a common team to find "
#| "shared solutions and address concerns, with a focus on giving voice rather "
#| "than on balance of power."
msgid ""
"The {team_name} is composed of a mix of representatives from different areas"
" of the project, named roles appointed by Red Hat, and a variable number of "
"seats connected to medium-term project goals.  Decisions are made by a "
"*consensus process*, in which we work together as a common team to find "
"shared solutions and address concerns, with a focus on giving voice rather "
"than on balance of power."
msgstr ""
"{team_name} består av en blandning av representanter från olika delar av "
"projektet, namngivna roller som utses av Red Hat och ett varierande antal "
"platser knutna till projektmål på medellång sikt. Beslut fattas genom en "
"*konsensusprocess*, där vi samarbetar som ett gemensamt team för att hitta "
"gemensamma lösningar och hantera farhågor, med fokus på att ge röst åt fler "
"snarare än på maktbalans."

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/index.adoc:13
#| msgid ""
#| "The Council is ultimately accountable for the Fedora Project as a whole, and"
#| " is responsible for providing advice to and oversight of other Fedora "
#| "governance bodies and teams as needed."
msgid ""
"The {team_name} is ultimately accountable for the Fedora Project as a whole,"
" and is responsible for providing advice to and oversight of other Fedora "
"governance bodies and teams as needed."
msgstr ""
"{team_name} är ytterst ansvarigt för Fedora-projektet som helhet och "
"ansvarar vid behov för att ge råd till och utöva tillsyn över andra styrande"
" organ och team inom Fedora."

